nsferred common area in this phase and other phases also to RWA/Local Body/Competent Authority as the prevailing rules and regulations in this regard. The Promoter may declare limited common areas out of the common areas in the future phases of the project land.\r\n\r\nThe promoter has decided that the Plot No. R-1 is self-consumed plot and it will be unavailable for sale. The Plot No. R-1 is a Group Housing Plot and Promoter shall sale developed units in the said Group Housing Project namely “Dhun Life R-1\" as per the approved building map. The Promoter has separately applied for RERA registration of the Group Housing Project namely \"Dhun Life R--1\" vide application number RAJ-RERA-APP-P-2026-11963","floors":"","basement":0,"plinth":0,"podium":0,"stilt":0,"parkingOpen":0,"parkingClose":0,"cars":0,"twoWheelers":0,"visitorCars":0,"buildingDocs":0,"constructionCost":55000000,"costByType":{"LandCost":540000000,"DevelopmentCost":105000000},"costDetail":[{"n":"Estimated Land Cost","t":"LandCost","e":270000000.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"For the purposes of sub-clause (D) of clause (I) of sub-section (2) of section 4, the land cost shall be the cost incurred by the promoter whether as an outright purchase, lease charges etc.","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Revenue or area share given to land owner in lieu of land under any kind of agreement such as Joint Venture, Joint Development etc, in case the Promoter is not the owner of the land.","t":"LandCost","e":270000000.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Amount paid to land owner. (Method of land valuation)","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Incidental costs related to acquisition of land such as stamp duty, brokerage, settlement costs of litigation, premiums paid to government authorities related to land.","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Interest on finance for purchase of land.","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Litigation costs incurred for land acquisition.","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Property and other taxes, fees, 